==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Just distract the Le'boins at the start with meat shields until Cadaver Bear digs, then once Cadaver Bear finishes digging, use [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] to distract it and spam units that outrange it like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] until Cadaver Bear dies.

==='''Chapter 2 & 3'''===
Not a hard level compared to other [[Zombie Outbreaks]] in this chapter. You should have your [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] prepared by the time the Zuches start to appear. If you are having trouble dealing with all of them at the same time, it is advised to bring a Unit Attack UP (Sm) [[Cat Combo|Combo]] with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Thankfully, the Le'Boins are weak enough for A. Bahamut to OHKO them. The Le'boins will give you a great bunch of money when killed, which can then be used to spawn your Zombie Killers to fight those incoming [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], making this stage a lot easier.

In the third chapter, just beware the long-distance burrow of Li'l Zyclone, then you should be fine dealing with these short-ranged Zombies.

